          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_water_refinement_gu",
          "gu_advance_refinement_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Forceful refinement Immortal Gu can directly refine the Immortal Gu of others. It was the original core of the Immortal Gu House Refinement Cauldron, but Shadow Sect had stolen it back then. In that earlier fight, rank eight Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus was also damaged and fell to rank seven.",
